{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">澳門下午大致多雲，風勢微弱。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">澳門氣象局稱，今晚會視乎沙德爾的發展情況，考慮發出一號風球。受到低壓系統和大陸性氣流共同影響，預計周二、三澳門風勢較大，有驟雨及幾陣雷暴。展望本周中後期天色好轉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.M.WEATHER-1630_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026fhZK8NZoMM1788169784.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.M.WEATHER-1630_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-31T10:20:05.480919+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}